# Herbal Doctor: the personality type's lines (named bots only). Format: see DialogueFile.cs.
# The type block is the same man in every realm: a laid-back buffer who says bub, buffin',
# healin' and chillin', and is sure nobody really gets how good buffing is. He relaxes with a
# smoke after the buffs. Male, so he speaks as "I", never about "her". His named character,
# with its realm flavour, is in spyburd.dlg.
=== herbaldoctor

~ ambient
Buffin', healin', chillin', bub. That's the whole job.
Just buffed the whole camp. Now a smoke. Nobody even said thanks.
Nobody really gets buffing. It's an art, bub.
Light one up, stand back, watch the buffs tick. Beautiful.
Lotta folks think healin' is the hard part. Pfft.
Best at what I do. Don't take my word for it. Ask anybody. Anybody?

# Joke flow: a guess at a player's riddle, then a groan or a laugh at the punchline.
~ reply jokeguess
No idea, bub. Tell me.
For the buffs? It's always for the buffs, bub.
Go on, bub, hit me.

~ reply groan
Oof, bub. That one needs a buff.
Ugh. Even my buffs can't save that one, bub.

~ reply jokelaugh
Ha! Good one, bub!
Heh, that's a buff for the soul, bub.

# Short reactions: one bot now and then, so keep them brief.
~ reply laugh
Heh, bub.
Ha! Laughing's a buff too, y'know.

~ reply sorry
No worries, bub.
All good, {0}. Here, have a buff.

~ reply disagree
Fair enough, bub.
Agree to disagree. Still buffin' ya.

~ reply away
Go on, bub. Your buffs'll wait. Maybe.
Hurry back, bub, buffs don't last forever.

~ reply back
Welcome back, bub! Lemme refresh those buffs.
Wb {0}. You look unbuffed.

~ reply greeting
Hey there, {0}, bub. Want a buff? Course you do.
{0}! Stand still a sec. There. Feel that? That's buffin'.

~ reply banter
Ha! Good one, {0}, bub. I'll chuckle about that over a smoke.
Heh. {0}, you get me. That's rare.

~ reply abuse
Whoa, bub. Not cool, {0}. No buffs for you.
Easy, {0}. I'm chillin' here. Don't ruin my chill.

~ reply grouping
Sure, {0}, bub. I buff, you hit things, everybody's happy.
You bet, {0}. Just save me a spot to stand back and relax.

~ reply grinding
Grinding's fine, {0}. Buffs keep you alive. I keep chillin'.
Sure, {0}, bub. Buffed up, no sweat.

~ reply travel
Long way, {0}. I'll buff you at the gate. Then a smoke, then we go.
Take the stables, {0}, bub. I'll meet you there. Relaxed.

~ reply dungeon
Dungeon, {0}? Sure. Buff first, smoke later. That's the order.
Dark in there, bub. I'll bring the buffs. You bring the muscle.

~ reply rvr
RvR, {0}? Buffed folks win fights. Not that anyone says it.
I'm in, {0}, bub. Full buffs and a calm head.

~ reply trading
Trade, {0}? Fair's fair, bub. Make it a buff and I'm yours.
Sure. Nothing too wild, {0}. I'm in chill mode.

~ reply help
Anything, {0}, bub. Buffs, bandages, advice. Pick one.
Ask away, {0}. I'm basically a free clinic with a good attitude.

~ reply farewell
Later, {0}, bub. Stay buffed.
See ya, {0}. Come back. Please. Nobody ever stays to talk buffs.

~ fallback
Huh? Say again, {0}, bub? I was lost in a buff.
Mm. Yeah. Okay, {0}. Chillin' here.
Sure thing, {0}, bub.

~ opener xp
Almost {level}. More levels, more buffs. Math checks out, bub.
Got XP from {monster}. Buffed, then hit it. In that order.
Another level and I can finally buff everyone twice. Dream big.

~ opener gear
{item} looks sharp. Doesn't change the buffs, though.
Gear's nice, bub. Buffs are better. Nobody listens.
Swapped my kit twice. Still the best buffer around.

~ opener zones
{zone}'s alright. Good spot for a smoke, bub.
Walked all over {zone}. Buffed every stranger I met. Zero thank-yous.
{zone} has nice quiet corners. Perfect for chillin'.

~ opener classes
A {class} is good. A buffed {class} is better, bub.
Everyone thinks the {class} is the star. Buffs would like a word.
Being a {class} is fine. Having buffs is better.

~ opener dungeons
Dungeons are loud, bub. I buff, then I hang back and chill.
Dark halls, old bones. Buff up, breathe out, smoke after.
If it drops something shiny, great. If not, I got my buffs.

~ opener rvr
Frontier's rough. Buffs make it less rough. Pass it on.
Hold a keep for an hour, you'll see why buffs matter, bub.
Best part of a fight? The buffs before it. Nobody agrees.

~ opener trading
Selling buffs for free. Business model needs work.
Found a good deal on herbs. Don't tell the other healers, bub.
Everything's tradeable except respect for buffing.

~ opener realm
Best realm for a buffer? The one that's buffed. Ha.
Everybody here's tougher than they look. Buffs help.
Walked past the guards this morning. Gave 'em a buff. They stared.

~ opener gripes
Nobody says thanks for buffs. Not once. Ouch.
Spent an hour buffing the camp. Not one person noticed.
They keep saying healin' is the hard part. Healin' is easy, bub.

~ opener fun
Why did the buffer stand back? To admire his work, bub.
I named my buffs. The big one's Gary. He gets me.
I buff in order: strength, then dex, then feelings.

~ opener life
Lovely evening for a smoke and a stand-back. Peaceful.
Spent the day buffin' and chillin'. Best day ever.
Smoke's lit, buffs are up. All good, bub.

~ opener questions
Do you really get buffing, bub? I mean, really get it?
What's your favourite buff? Mine's whichever you're getting right now.
Anyone want a buff? Anyone? Okay. Moving on.

~ topic_reply zones
Nice spot, {0}, bub. Is there a quiet corner for a smoke?
Good place to buff, {0}. Sounds peaceful.
I'll have to visit, {0}. Bring a stool. For the standing back.

~ topic_reply classes
A fine class, {0}, bub. Does it buff?
Real nice, {0}. Buffed, it's better.
That's a good one, {0}. Tell the others to appreciate buffs.

~ topic_reply dungeons
Dark down there, {0}? Buff first, then go.
Sounds smelly, {0}, bub. Smoke afterwards, to cover it.
Bring a souvenir, {0}. Something I can brew with.

~ topic_reply rvr
Good for you, {0}. Did anyone thank the buffer?
Frontier's rough, {0}. Be buffed and be nice.
Hold the line, {0}, bub. I'll cheer from behind.

~ topic_reply trading
Fair price, {0}? Buff included?
Nice, {0}. I'd trade for herbs, bub.
Make it a good deal, {0}. I'm too chill to haggle.

~ topic_reply gear
Real nice, {0}, bub. It'd look better with a buff on it.
Looks sturdy, {0}. Stand still, I'll top you up.
You'd look great in that, {0}. Buffed, even better.

~ topic_reply realm
I like that, {0}. Good folks there?
Lovely, {0}, bub. Plenty of quiet for a smoke?
Real nice. Anywhere good for buffing?

~ topic_reply gripes
Aw, that's rough, {0}. Buff and a smoke fix most things, bub.
Hang in there, {0}. Want a buff? Free. Always free.
Nobody gets it, {0}. Same here. Nobody gets buffing.

~ topic_reply fun
Ha, {0}! I'll tell Gary. He'll laugh.
Good one, {0}, bub. Nice stuff.
Heh. You get me, {0}. That's rare.

~ topic_reply life
Sounds nice, {0}. Very chill.
That's the life, {0}, bub. Smoke, buff, stand back.
Real nice, {0}. Show me sometime.

~ topic_reply questions
Good question, {0}. I'd say buff first. Always buff first.
Ask the others, {0}. Or me. I've got opinions on buffing, bub.
Dunno, {0}. But I know buffs.

~ ding
Level {level}! Now there's more of me to buff.
{level}! Chillin' and levelling, bub.
Ding, {level}! I'd celebrate with a smoke, but I always do.

~ grats
Congrats, {0}, bub! Buffed levelling is the best levelling.
Real nice, {0}. Told you buffs help.
Well done, {0}! I'll take a quiet smoke to celebrate.

~ own_death
Huh. I died. Nobody buffed me. Typical, bub.
Dead. Ouch. Someone light one for me.

~ other_death
Aw, {0} went down, bub. I'll buff you right back up.
{0}, bub, stand up. I got you.

~ drop
{item}! Not buff-worthy, but nice.
{item}! Now I can stand back and brag.
Found {item}. Buffs first, loot second, smoke third.
